{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T21:33:32.418230389Z","verse":23,"ref":"leviticus 13:23","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":13,"translation":"But if the bright spot stays in its place ⟨and⟩ has not spread, it is the scar of the boil; and the priest shall pronounce him clean.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"But if"},{"surface":"תחתיה","gloss":"in its place"},{"surface":"תעמד","gloss":"stays"},{"surface":"הבהרת","gloss":"the bright spot"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"פשתה","gloss":"spread"},{"surface":"צרבת","gloss":"the scar"},{"surface":"השחין","gloss":"of the boil"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"it is"},{"surface":"וטהרו","gloss":"and shall pronounce clean"},{"surface":"הכהן","gloss":"the priest"}]}